### Feature Invoice — DELETE físico / DELETE lógico (status = inactive)
### Leyenda: JWT + RBAC (login como admin + Authorization: Bearer)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/session/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}

###
@id = 1

# @name deleteInvoicePhysical
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

# @name deleteInvoiceLogical
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/invoices/{{id}}/deactivate
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
